## Two APIs

CadQuery has two APIs. Use the fluent (Workplane) API for most tasks.

Fluent (Workplane) API — chains operations on a Workplane object:
```python
import cadquery as cq
result = cq.Workplane("XY").box(10, 10, 10).faces(">Z").hole(3)
```

Free Function API — explicit free functions, no hidden state:
```python
from cadquery.func import *
b = box(10, 10, 10)
result = b - cylinder(1.5, 10)
```

Do not mix the two APIs in the same script.

